<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 22.59 pct. [CORRECTED 22:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 22.59 pct. [CORRECTED 22:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate (TIIE) rose 144 basis points to 22.59 percent Thursday from 21.15 percent Wednesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>(Corrects Thursday's rise from 140 basis points and percentage from 22.55 percent).</p>
<p>TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
